<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT REVISES DOWN 1996 PROFITS.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT REVISES DOWN 1996 PROFITS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stalexport preliminary results</p>
<p>for the period ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER			   1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    33.36   vs    33.02</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			41.34   vs    75.99</p>
<p>    net profit			    22.66   vs    46.90</p>
<p>NOTE: Earlier the company reported its net profit at 25.7</p>
<p>million zlotys and pre-tax profit at 44.3 million.</p>
<p>    net sales			  1,633.26   vs 1,824.01</p>
<p>    costs of sales		   1,526.83   vs 1,702.61</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.22   vs     0.76</p>
<p>    income tax			    18.58   vs    28.81</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.10   vs     0.28</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  79.88   vs    88.30</p>
<p>    financial costs		     73.65   vs    48.10</p>
<p>    investment			   173.65   vs    58.54</p>
<p>    depreciation			   2.58   vs     1.47</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
